  "body": "Information Pack: https://vltre.co/tO8bHX\r\n\r\nMore Bedrooms. More Possibilities. More Room to Live.\r\n\r\nWelcome to Lot 2 at 14 Kiri Place, Mairangi Bay - a beautifully crafted brand-new residence offering something increasingly sought-after: five bedrooms in a contemporary, thoughtfully designed home.\r\n\r\nIf space, flexibility and modern living are high on your priority list, this home deserves your attention.\r\n\r\nWith five bedrooms, this property provides exceptional flexibility for larger families, professionals working from home or those who simply appreciate having additional space.\r\n\r\nDesigned Around Your Lifestyle\r\n\r\n*  Five generously proportioned bedrooms\r\n*  Two stylish, fully tiled bathrooms\r\n*  Additional guest toilet downstairs\r\n*  Internal-access garage\r\n*  Designer kitchen featuring premium appliances and elegant stone benchtops\r\n*  Spacious open-plan living and dining\r\n*  Outdoor decking for entertaining and relaxing\r\n\r\nContemporary Comforts\r\n\r\n*  Freehold title - no body corporate fees\r\n*  Underfloor heating for year-round comfort\r\n*  Designer bathrooms with contemporary finishes and feature lighting\r\n*  Air conditioning in the living area and master bedroom\r\n*  Modern architectural design\r\n*  Beautiful contemporary interiors\r\n\r\nEducation Excellence - Rangitoto College Zone\r\n\r\nEnjoy the advantage of being within the sought-after Rangitoto College zone.\r\n\r\nFor families prioritising education, this is an opportunity to combine a quality new home with an established and highly desirable school zone.\r\n\r\nConnected North Shore Living\r\n\r\nConveniently positioned close to Constellation Drive motorway connections, local shopping centres, cafés, restaurants, recreational facilities and beautiful beaches.\r\n\r\nFive bedrooms. Modern design. A location families love.\r\n\r\nDon't compromise on space when you can have it all.\r\n\r\nDiscover the difference at Lot 2, 14 Kiri Place!\r\n\r\n\r\nPLEASE NOTE: Specified floor and land area sizes have been obtained from sources such as Property Guru, Auckland Council (LIM) or Title documents. They have not been measured by the Salesperson or The WORX Real Estate / Real Estate Brokers Limited. We recommend you seek your own independent legal advice if these sizes are material to your purchasing decision.",
